<!--
  GB edition override: the same resource name, drawn as a pound sign.

  The icon is referenced from three region-neutral places — the two dashboard
  "Tariff Plan" accordions (UI2DashboardFragment.kt:377, :600) and the drawer's
  Supplier Plans item (UI2NavigationDrawer.kt:114) — so a GB build was showing a
  euro glyph above figures denominated in £. Overriding the drawable per flavor
  mirrors what app/src/gb/res/values/strings.xml already does for the legacy
  currency-bearing strings, and needs no code change: same name, same 24dp
  viewport, resolved by flavor at build time.

  Material Symbols "currency_pound" path, unmodified.
-->
